---
Title: Cheesy Nachos
Tags: Prospects, Beef, Mexican
---

Make Birra with Sauce

Melt the @Cheddar Cheese{2 cups} and @Monterey Jack Cheese{2 cups} in a #saucepan{}.

Drop @Tortilla Chips{} onto cheese and fold the Cheese onto the Chips.

Recommend: Top with Birra, raw Onions, Cilantro, Birra Sauce, White Sauce
